<section class="day-back" aria-label="日子的背面" data-needs-js>
  <div class="notebook-guest" data-note-guest>
    <p class="paper-label">日子的背面</p>
    <p>解锁后，翻看我们的记录</p>
    <button class="pencil-button" type="button" data-open-login data-needs-js>解锁手账</button>
  </div>
  <div class="notebook-loading" data-note-loading hidden>
    <p data-note-loading-status role="status">正在打开手账…</p>
    <button class="text-button" type="button" data-note-retry hidden>重新连接</button>
  </div>
  <div data-note-private hidden>
    <div class="day-back-heading">
      <div><p class="paper-label">日子的背面</p><h3 id="day-back-title" data-note-date>给今天留一句</h3></div>
      <button class="pencil-button" type="button" data-note-edit><span data-note-edit-label>写一句</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
    </div>
    <p class="day-back-text" data-note-text>这一天还空着。想记的时候，再写。</p>
    <p class="paper-local">登录后，可以在手账里查看和修改。</p>
    <form data-note-form hidden class="note-editor">
      <label class="sr-only" for="day-note">这一天想记下的话</label>
      <textarea id="day-note" maxlength="2000" rows="4" placeholder="发生了什么，或只是今天的一句话。"></textarea>
      <div class="paper-actions"><button class="pencil-button" type="submit">收好这一句</button><button class="text-button" type="button" data-note-cancel>取消</button><button class="text-button" type="button" data-note-delete hidden>移除这一句</button></div>
    </form>
    <div class="note-conflict" data-note-conflict hidden>
      <p>这一天在手账里有新内容。草稿还在，可以先刷新对照。</p>
      <button class="text-button" type="button" data-note-refresh>刷新查看</button>
      <p class="note-conflict-latest" data-note-latest hidden></p>
    </div>
    <p class="notebook-status" data-note-status role="status"></p>
    <button class="text-button" type="button" data-note-undo hidden>撤销移除这一句</button>
    <details class="note-index"><summary>翻看写过的日子 <span data-notes-count>0</span></summary><div data-notes-list></div></details>
  </div>
</section>
